DESCRIPTION:🌯 Chipotle Fundraiser — Support CCOM's MS Class of 2029!\n\nCraving a burrito or bowl after a long day of studying or exams? Join us at Chipotle for a night of good food! A portion of every purchase goes straight towards funding our class events (particularly our Match Day Celebration). \n\n📍 Chipotle @ Oak Brook\n🗓️ Tuesday\, October 13th from 4-8pm\n🎟️ Show this flyer (digital or printed) or mention the fundraiser at check out. If you're in a rush\,  you can order online and pick up your meal using this Promo Code: JPZVGKP \n\nThis event is open to all students on campus\, so bring your friends\, roommates\, and study group. \n\nSee you there! 🥑\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377612
